{"seq":2,"slug":"smart-routing-failover-strategy","title":"智能路由、通道选择与降级策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/batch-routing-execution/smart-routing-failover-strategy","wordCount":2842,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能路由-通道选择与降级策略\">智能路由、通道选择与降级策略</h1><p>一笔 12 美元的菲律宾卖家打款，如果走错通道，可能既付了 25 美元的电汇手续费、又在三天后才到账，而正确的那条路成本不到 0.2 美元、60 秒内到账。批量打款系统里，路由不是&quot;选一个服务商&quot;这么简单，而是<strong>成本、时效、成功率、合规</strong>四约束下实时求解的决策函数，并且必须在通道宕机时自动降级、抖动时自动熔断、任何一次重试都不重复付款。通道本身的分族与清算语义见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../global-disbursement-rail/rail-types-clearing-networks\">全球付款通道类型与清算网络对比</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>智能路由（smart routing）指的是：给定一笔应付（payable），系统在多个可用通道中选出<strong>当前最优</strong>的一条，并在其失败时按预设顺序降级到次优通道。它必须把三样东西分开建模，否则会退化成一张写死的 if-else 表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可行性筛选（eligibility）</strong>：哪些通道<strong>能</strong>承接这笔款。受币种、国家、收款账户类型、金额上下限、通道覆盖（corridor）与合规白名单约束。硬过滤，不参与打分。</li>\n<li><strong>成本与时效估计（estimation）</strong>：对每个可行通道算出预计手续费、FX 点差、到账时点、当前成功率。这些量随负载变化，必须来自可观测数据而非静态配置。</li>\n<li><strong>决策与执行（decision &amp; execution）</strong>：按策略打分选出主通道，写入幂等键，调用通道 API，异步回写账本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一次批量打款的路由链路抽象成下面这条流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[批量打款批次] --&gt; B[逐笔 payable 展开]&#10;    B --&gt; C{可行性筛选}&#10;    C --&gt;|币种/国家/账户类型/限额| D[候选通道集合]&#10;    C --&gt;|无候选| E[进入人工待处理队列]&#10;    D --&gt; F[多维打分排序]&#10;    F --&gt; G[选主通道]&#10;    G --&gt; H[生成幂等键 提交报文]&#10;    H --&gt; I{通道回调}&#10;    I --&gt;|成功| J[回写 状态 SUCCESS]&#10;    I --&gt;|可重试失败| K[降级到次优通道]&#10;    I --&gt;|不可重试失败| L[终态 FAILED 转人工]&#10;    I --&gt;|超时/未知| M[进入不确定态 对账兜底]&#10;    K --&gt; H&#10;    K --&gt;|候选耗尽| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[批量打款批次] --&gt; B[逐笔 payable 展开]\n    B --&gt; C{可行性筛选}\n    C --&gt;|币种/国家/账户类型/限额| D[候选通道集合]\n    C --&gt;|无候选| E[进入人工待处理队列]\n    D --&gt; F[多维打分排序]\n    F --&gt; G[选主通道]\n    G --&gt; H[生成幂等键 提交报文]\n    H --&gt; I{通道回调}\n    I --&gt;|成功| J[回写 状态 SUCCESS]\n    I --&gt;|可重试失败| K[降级到次优通道]\n    I --&gt;|不可重试失败| L[终态 FAILED 转人工]\n    I --&gt;|超时/未知| M[进入不确定态 对账兜底]\n    K --&gt; H\n    K --&gt;|候选耗尽| E</pre><p>路由决策用到的维度可先用一张表压住，每维都对应一个可采集字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>取值来源</th>\n<th>影响面</th>\n<th>恶化时的降级动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖（corridor）</td>\n<td>通道能力矩阵（国家 × 币种 × 账户类型）</td>\n<td>可行性</td>\n<td>剔除候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手续费率</td>\n<td>通道合同 + 浮动费率 API</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>权重下调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FX 点差</td>\n<td>通道报价 / 中间价对比</td>\n<td>成本（跨境占比高）</td>\n<td>权重下调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预计到账时效</td>\n<td>通道 SLA + 清算窗口</td>\n<td>时效</td>\n<td>超阈值则剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近窗成功率</td>\n<td>通道回调统计（滚动 5-15 分钟）</td>\n<td>成功率</td>\n<td>低于熔断线则剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限额与配额</td>\n<td>通道每日/单笔限额、剩余额度</td>\n<td>可行性</td>\n<td>额度耗尽则剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规状态</td>\n<td>制裁筛查、收款国限制、KYC 状态</td>\n<td>可行性</td>\n<td>命中即硬阻断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途并发</td>\n<td>该通道当前未回执笔数</td>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>超水位则排队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"打分模型与成本-时效权衡\">打分模型与成本-时效权衡</h2><p>决策阶段把可行性筛选后的通道集合按一个标量分数排序。最实用的形式是<strong>加权归一化打分</strong>：把每一维映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再按业务权重加权求和。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>C</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i = w_c \\cdot \\hat{C}_i + w_s \\cdot \\hat{T}_i + w_r \\cdot \\hat{R}_i + w_p \\cdot \\hat{P}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>C</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{C}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化成本（越低越好，故取反），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时效得分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{R}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是滚动成功率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{P}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"ms